  "acceptance": [
    "Existing Sidebar/Chat exposes the bound stable coordinator, Task Ledger references, worker receipts, pause/resume, and observed owner resource facts without creating a second task or resource authority.",
    "The coordinator renders the actual terminal completion batch outcome/delivery and opens both the child transcript and Task Ledger source.",
    "Switching, BrowserWindow minimize/restore, keyboard operation, four locales, responsive rendering, completion visibility, and a quiet no-new-result window passed in built Electron; fork and handoff regression journeys also passed.",
